{
  "id": "ss.base.line",
  "name": "The line",
  "description": "A cord between two steel stakes with pages pegged out on it: the ones not filed into the seven boxes yet (A055), hung where the wind can read them. Six pages in bone and husk, each written on, and one that came off the line and lies in the dirt under it. The pages swing on their pegs, one after another down the line (`stir`).",
